d":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FzHVtXe8-3fFclRBUI9YdA","review_id":"9IPxWfhDTfZaUNZ0XN4Sag","date":"2014-09-16T11:08:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9380226731300354,"text_excerpt":"Let me start my saying that I am the exact opposite of a Thai food connoisseur. The only other Thai restaurant that I had been to at this point was a little place in Hammond years ago. A little over a month ago, I received a groupon for La Thai for my birthday. I had already been out a few times for my birthday, so I decided to spare my boyfriend the pain of paying for another meal as long as he was willing to try Thai. He had never ever been to a Thai restaurant. When we walked in, I was very surprised on how pretty the restaurant is. We were seated immediately. We had a really great server, she was very attentive and sweet. We ordered the calamari for an appetizer which I thought was ve..."},{"business_id":"FzHVtXe8-3fFclRBUI9YdA","review_id":"ahMccVENO5BG-lbRno_veg","date":"2017-12-31T15:44:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9374209642410278,"text_excerpt":"Just going to put it out there early that this is my favorite Thai in the city. I first had one of their dishes at Tales of the Toddy and I was like whoa. It wasn't all the Toddy(s) I drank talking either. I finally got around to making it in the brick and mortar spot though. LOVE the decor. It was lunch time and there weren't many people so we were allowed to choose our seating. Now it did take some time for our food to come out. We had soups and entrees. It tasted amazing."},{"business_id":"FzHVtXe8-3fFclRBUI9YdA","review_id":"VM8dcTm_qy-zszyYFFOUUg","date":"2011-08-25T13:53:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9369194507598877,"text_excerpt":"I eat here often and I really like this place. My favorite thing is the hot & sour soup and it always puts me in a good mood to eat that awesome stuff. They usually have a $5 appetizer special on Tuesday nights that brings in a fun crowd. They have some very tasty options on the menu and some unique \"cajun Thai\" fusion dishes that work well. The owners and staff have always been very helpful and want you to enjoy your food."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FzHVtXe8-3fFclRBUI9YdA","photo_id":"Bwalpa8Zjsl9s3-byf7f9g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Bwalpa8Zjsl9s3-byf7f9g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9050270915031433},{"business_id":"FzHVtXe8-3fFclRBUI9YdA","photo_id":"VZaCKzK1QWgmrDiXYpiX-w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VZaCKzK1QWgmrDiXYpiX-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9037986397743225},{"business_id":"FzHVtXe8-3fFclRBUI9YdA","photo_id":"UDyMF1_r0dyGnSxiqVlxmg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/UDyMF1_r0dyGnSxiqVlxmg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8824965357780457},{"business_id":"FzHVtXe8-3fFclRBUI9YdA","photo_id":"4M1sx9C4UrCU8-6HquovZA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4M1sx9C4UrCU8-6HquovZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.86173415184021}]},"notebook_case":null}
